| `scripts/apply_refactor.py --gate` | string | `'verify'` | a make target `config/project.json` `make_targets.gate_effects` lets `scripts/run_make_target.py` run, or `none` | `scripts/apply_refactor.py` | Make target to gate on (default: verify); none skips the gate and is for a human caller only, never an agent. A spec that names a gate is refused. | choosing the edit: `scripts/refactor_practice.py` | always |
